00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:55.810
Do I know what the future holds?

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:56.773
No, I'm not God.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.773
Do I believe in God? Yes. Do I pray? Yes.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:04.850
