00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:18.890
Right now, do I want it?

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.083
I'll be honest, no.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:22.950
To be quite honest,

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:25.610
