00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.760
without your permission.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.200
That's bad.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.680
And this has happened time and time again,

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.193
but I have no control over it.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.080
It's something that
centers right in my mind.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.040
I could be doing good one minute,

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.793
I might do good for months,

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.650
